about/">About</a><a data-nav-key="circle" href="/community/network">The Circle</a><a data-nav-key="store" href="https://momentous-store.netlify.app/">Momentous store</a><a data-nav-key="launch" href="/kickstarter/">Kickstarter plans</a><a data-nav-key="downloads" href="/downloads/">Downloads &amp; availability</a><a data-nav-key="support" href="/testing/">Support &amp; feedback</a><a data-nav-key="releases" href="/release-notes/">Release notes</a><a data-nav-key="privacy" href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></nav></details></div></header><main id="main" tabindex="-1"><nav class="pr-nav product-polish-nav" aria-label="On this product page"><span>Bounce</span><div class="pr-nav-links"><a href="#product-lessons">Try it</a><a href="#product-features">Features</a><a class="product-open-link" href="https://bounce.thecreatingco.com/browser/">Open app <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></nav><section class="ph ph-bounce" id="top" data-product-hero="bounce"><div class="ph-copy"><!-- PRODUCT-FAMILY:START --><p class="product-family" data-product-family="other-apps"><a href="/#other-apps">Other apps from thecreateco</a></p><!-- PRODUCT-FAMILY:END --><p class="ph-label">Local music player / OPEN FOR EXPLORATION</p><h1>Bounce</h1><p class="ph-promise">Your music. A little more feeling.</p><p class="ph-description">Bring your own audio, shape the listening balance and build a queue you want to stay with.</p><div class="ph-actions"><a class="ph-open" href="https://bounce.thecreatingco.com/browser/">Open Bounce</a><a href="#product-lessons">Try the listening session</a></div><p class="ph-scope">Local music player · local audio, EQ and saved playlists</p><!-- ALPHA-ACCESS:START --><p class="other-app-status">Public alpha · <a href="#browser">Availability &amp; current scope</a> · <a href="/testing/?product=bounce#feedback">Send feedback</a></p><!-- ALPHA-ACCESS:END --></div><div class="ph-media"><figure class="other-app-hero other-app-bounce"><a href="#product-lessons" aria-label="Try Bounce"><img src="/assets/app-logos/bounce.svg" alt="Bounce app icon" width="1710" height="1069" fetchpriority="high"></a></figure></div></section><section class="tcc-product-story" data-product-story="bounce" style="--story-accent:#ff8570" aria-labelledby="product-story-bounce-title"><div class="tcc-story-heading"><p class="tcc-story-kicker">A VISUAL TOUR · BOUNCE</p><h2 id="product-story-bounce-title">The work, as it comes together.</h2><p>Explore how Bounce brings local audio, sound shaping and a saved playlist into one personal listening flow.</p></div><div class="tcc-story-layout"><div class="tcc-story-visual" data-story-visual><div class="tcc-story-frames"><figure class="tcc-story-frame" id="product-story-bounce-1" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" data-story-frame><img src="/assets/after-hours/bounce-01-listening.png" alt="Bounce browser companion playing a local audio example." loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="1000"><figcaption>Bounce browser companion playing a local audio example.</figcaption></figure><figure class="tcc-story-frame" id="product-story-bounce-2" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" data-story-frame><img src="/assets/after-hours/bounce-02-eq-seek.png" alt="Bounce browser companion showing equalizer and seek controls." loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="1000"><figcaption>Bounce browser companion showing equalizer and seek controls.</figcaption></figure><figure class="tcc-story-frame" id="product-story-bounce-3" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" data-story-frame><img src="/assets/after-hours/bounce-03-search.png" alt="Bounce browser companion searching a local music library." loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="1000"><figcaption>Bounce browser companion searching a local music library.</figcaption></figure><figure class="tcc-story-frame" id="product-story-bounce-4" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" data-story-frame><img src="/assets/after-hours/bounce-04-retained.png" alt="Bounce browser companion showing a retained playlist example." loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="1000"><figcaption>Bounce browser companion showing a retained playlist example.</figcaption></figure></div><nav class="tcc-story-controls" data-story-controls role="tablist" aria-label="Bounce visual tour" hidden></nav></div><div class="tcc-story-copy"><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">01 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 04</p><h3>Bring your own music</h3><p>Start with audio files you choose; Bounce has no streaming catalog.</p></article><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">02 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 04</p><h3>Shape the sound</h3><p>Use the browser companion&#x27;s EQ controls to adjust the listening balance.</p></article><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">03 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 04</p><h3>Find a track</h3><p>Search the local library and move through the queue.</p></article><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">04 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 04</p><h3>Keep a playlist</h3><p>Save a local playlist for your next browser session.</p></article><p class="tcc-story-status tcc-story-sr-only" data-story-status role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p></div></div></section><!-- PRODUCT-REFRESH:START --><section class="mini-player" id="product-lessons" data-mini-product="bounce" aria-label="Bounce mini lessons"><div class="mini-heading"><h2>Shape your listening session.</h2></div><div class="mini-controls" role="group" aria-label="Lesson navigation"><label for="mini-lesson-bounce">Choose a lesson</label><button type="button" data-mini-cycle="previous" aria-label="Previous lesson" title="Previous lesson"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg></button><select id="mini-lesson-bounce" data-mini-select><option value="warmth" data-src="/learn/product-try/bounce/?miniLesson=warmth" data-poster="/assets/presentation/bounce-listening-viewport.png" data-description="Audition the Bass band on the original recording.">Shape the low end</option><option value="voice" data-src="/learn/product-try/bounce/?miniLesson=voice" data-poster="/assets/presentation/bounce-listening-viewport.png" data-description="Audition Mid and compare the presence of instruments and voice.">Find the middle</option><option value="air" data-src="/learn/product-try/bounce/?miniLesson=air" data-poster="/assets/presentation/bounce-listening-viewport.png" data-description="Audition Treble and return to a neutral EQ for comparison.">Refine the top end</option></select><button type="button" data-mini-cycle="next" aria-label="Next lesson" title="Next lesson"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></button><p class="mini-count" data-mini-count role="status" aria-live="polite">Lesson 1 of 3</p></div><div class="mini-box"><header class="mini-bar"><h3 data-mini-title>Shape the low end</h3><button type="button" data-mini-expand aria-label="Expand lesson" title="Expand lesson"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></header><div class="mini-stage" data-mini-stage><img data-mini-poster src="/assets/presentation/bounce-listening-viewport.png" alt="Shape the low end product example" loading="lazy"><button type="button" data-mini-open>Open lesson</button></div><footer class="mini-footer"><p data-mini-description>Audition the Bass band on the original recording.</p><p role="status" data-mini-status></p><a data-mini-full href="/learn/product-try/bounce/?miniLesson=warmth">Continue this lesson</a></footer></div></section><!-- PRODUCT-REFRESH:END --><!-- PRODUCT-EXAMPLES:START --><!-- PRODUCT-LESSONS:START --><!-- PRODUCT-LESSONS:END --><!-- PRODUCT-EXAMPLES:END --><!-- PRODUCT-FEATURES:START --><section class="pf" id="product-features" aria-labelledby="pf-title" data-product-features="bounce" style="--pf-accent:#ff8570"><div class="pf-intro"><div><p class="pf-eyebrow">INSIDE BOUNCE</p><h2 id="pf-title">What Bounce can do.</h2><p class="pf-lede">A focused home for the music files you own.</p></div><p class="pf-total"><strong>15</strong><span>features to explore</span></p></div><aside class="pf-scope" aria-label="Edition and availability"><p><strong>Full product inventory. Web, native and experimental capabilities vary by edition.</strong> Desktop, browser, and mobile are separate implementations. Format support varies, and the mobile implementation is not a publicly released iOS download. Bounce does not include a streaming catalog.</p></aside><div class="pr-search"><label for="pr-feature-search">Find a capability</label><input id="pr-feature-search" type="search" data-pr-search placeholder="Search tools, workflows or editions" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="pr-feature-status"><p id="pr-feature-status" data-pr-search-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><nav class="pf-jump" aria-label="Feature categories"><a href="#pf-bounce-1">Listen your way</a><a href="#pf-bounce-2">Explore your music</a><a href="#pf-bounce-3">Keep your collection &amp; shape the sound</a><a href="#pf-bounce-4">Browser &amp; mobile workflows</a></nav><details class="pf-group" id="pf-bounce-1"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Listen your way</h3><span class="pf-group-count">3 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Local playback</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Play supported MP3, FLAC, WAV, AIFF, OGG, and platform-dependent additional formats.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Transport controls</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Play/pause, previous/next, seek, and automatic advancement.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Listening modes</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Shuffle and repeat off/all/one.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-bounce-2"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Explore your music</h3><span class="pf-group-count">6 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Music-folder scanning</h4><span class="pf-edition">desktop</span></div><p>Scan folders recursively and discover added files.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Metadata</h4><span class="pf-edition">desktop/mobile</span></div><p>Read supported tags and embedded artwork, with filename or folder fallbacks.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Library browsing</h4><span class="pf-edition">desktop/mobile</span></div><p>Songs, albums, artists, and playlists.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Search and sorting</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Find tracks and sort supported library views.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Album artwork</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Browse covers and use a large-art now-playing screen.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Playlists</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Create lists, add tracks or albums, remove entries, and reorder them.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-bounce-3"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Keep your collection &amp; shape the sound</h3><span class="pf-group-count">3 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Persistent collection</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Retain library information, playlists, and playback preferences.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Sound shaping</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Five-band EQ in the desktop engine; bass, mid, and treble controls in the browser companion.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Desktop volume</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>A dB-based level control with boost and a limiting output stage.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-bounce-4"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>Browser &amp; mobile workflows</h3><span class="pf-group-count">3 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Browser queue</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Import files, search tracks, reorder the queue, and save a local browser library.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Playlist export</h4><span class="pf-edition">web</span></div><p>Download a named playlist listing.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Mobile implementation</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>System file import, touch-oriented browsing and now-playing views, background audio, and lock-screen metadata.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details></section><!-- PRODUCT-FEATURES:END --><div class="section" style="padding-block:0"></div><!-- AFTER-HOURS:bounce:START --><section class="ah" id="after-hours-bounce" data-after-hours="bounce" style="--ah-accent:#873b24"><p class="ah-eyebrow">AFTER HOURS / Bounce / Local music player</p><h2>A session worth returning to.</h2><p class="ah-deck">Bring the four original parts and the finished mix into one listening queue. Shape the sound, choose an order, and save it on this device.</p><div class="ah-chapters" role="tablist" aria-label="After Hours Listening Session chapters"><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-bounce-tab-0" aria-controls="after-hours-bounce-panel-0" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0"><span>01</span>Begin with the finished mix</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-bounce-tab-1" aria-controls="after-hours-bounce-panel-1" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>02</span>Choose a passage</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-bounce-tab-2" aria-controls="after-hours-bounce-panel-2" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>03</span>Find a part</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-bounce-tab-3" aria-controls="after-hours-bounce-panel-3" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>04</span>Return to After Hours</button></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-bounce-panel-0" aria-labelledby="after-hours-bounce-tab-0" ><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/bounce-01-listening.png" alt="Bounce: Begin with the finished mix. The verified StemDeck output plays alongside its four original source parts in a new five-track collection." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Begin with the finished mix</h3><p>The verified StemDeck output plays alongside its four original source parts in a new five-track collection.</p></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-bounce-panel-1" aria-labelledby="after-hours-bounce-tab-1" hidden><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/bounce-02-eq-seek.png" alt="Bounce: Choose a passage. Bass moves to +1 dB, mid to 0 dB and treble to +4 dB. Seeking to about eight seconds picks out a passage in the 18-second mix." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Choose a passage</h3><p>Bass moves to +1 dB, mid to 0 dB and treble to +4 dB. Seeking to about eight seconds picks out a passage in the 18-second mix.</p></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-bounce-panel-2" aria-labelledby="after-hours-bounce-tab-2" hidden><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/bounce-03-search.png" alt="Bounce: Find a part. A search for Harmony isolates the matching track. The queue was arranged to move from the complete mix through harmony, melody, bass and percussion." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Find a part</h3><p>A search for Harmony isolates the matching track. The queue was arranged to move from the complete mix through harmony, melody, bass and percussion.</p></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-bounce-panel-3" aria-labelledby="after-hours-bounce-tab-3" hidden><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/bounce-04-retained.png" alt="Bounce: Return to After Hours. The library is saved as After Hours. After reload, all five tracks return in the chosen order, with the playlist name and EQ settings retained." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Return to After Hours</h3><p>The library is saved as After Hours. After reload, all five tracks return in the chosen order, with the playlist name and EQ settings retained.</p></div></div><p class="ah-count" data-ah-count role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="ah-actions"><a class="ah-primary" href="https://bounce.thecreatingco.com/browser/">Open Bounce ↗</a><button type="button" data-ah-expand>Inspect the screenshot</button></div><div class="ah-output"><h3>The mix in this session</h3><p>The original StemDeck output used in the playlist. This download does not bake in Bounce’s listening EQ.</p><audio controls preload="none" aria-label="The mix in this session"><source src="/assets/after-hours/outputs/after-hours-evening-mix.wav" type="audio/wav"></audio></div><div class="ah-actions"><a href="/assets/after-hours/outputs/after-hours-playlist.json" download>Download the playlist file list</a></div><p class="ah-note">Actual browser companion. The exported JSON is a playlist file list with filenames and sizes; audio is not embedded in that file. Saved audio copies remain local to this browser and can be cleared or evicted. Original source files were retained.</p><dialog aria-labelledby="after-hours-bounce-dialog-title"><button type="button" autofocus>Close screenshot</button><p id="after-hours-bounce-dialog-title" data-ah-dialog-title></p><img alt=""></dialog></section><!-- AFTER-HOURS:bounce:END --><section class="scope-section section" id="browser"><div><p class="overline">YOUR BROWSER EDITION</p><h2>Your web edition.</h2><p>Play your audio, search a local queue, adjust EQ, and save a playlist in this browser.</p><details open><summary>Current limitations</summary><p>Browser codecs determine which files play. Files and playlists stay in this browser; storage may be cleared. This companion does not include the native tag reader, desktop audio engine or a streaming catalog.</p></details></div><div class="try-card"><h3>One good first test</h3><ol><li><span>01</span>Add a few audio files or load the original studies.</li><li><span>02</span>Play, seek, change EQ and reorder your queue.</li><li><span>03</span>Save a playlist and return after a reload.</li></ol><a class="button accent primary-app" href="https://bounce.thecreatingco.com/browser/">Open the browser companion</a><a