el" tabindex="0" data-story-frame><img src="/assets/creative-tools/canvas.webp" alt="Canvas starting workspace for an audio-reactive visual." loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="1000"><figcaption>Canvas starting workspace for an audio-reactive visual.</figcaption></figure><figure class="tcc-story-frame" id="product-story-canvas-2" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" data-story-frame><img src="/assets/tool-products/canvas.webp" alt="Canvas actual workspace capture showing visual controls." loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="1000"><figcaption>Canvas actual workspace capture showing visual controls.</figcaption></figure></div><nav class="tcc-story-controls" data-story-controls role="tablist" aria-label="Canvas visual tour" hidden></nav></div><div class="tcc-story-copy"><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">01 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 02</p><h3>Start with a track</h3><p>Bring audio into the visual workspace to shape a loop around it.</p></article><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">02 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 02</p><h3>Shape the visual</h3><p>Explore the current loop controls in an actual Canvas capture.</p></article><p class="tcc-story-status tcc-story-sr-only" data-story-status role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-band" id="what-it-does" aria-labelledby="features-title"><div class="tp-inner"><p class="tp-eyebrow">FROM IDEA TO OUTPUT</p><h2 id="features-title">Make it your own.</h2><div class="tp-features"><div class="tp-feature"><span class="tp-number">01</span><h3>A visual that listens</h3><p>Use the track&#x27;s rhythm to drive scene movement.</p></div><div class="tp-feature"><span class="tp-number">02</span><h3>Make the cover move</h3><p>Bring artwork, palette choices and title/artist text into the composition.</p></div><div class="tp-feature"><span class="tp-number">03</span><h3>Export for the destination</h3><p>Keep Spotify Canvas silent; include audio for a social clip when appropriate.</p></div></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-band tp-making" id="make" aria-labelledby="make-title"><span id="how-it-works"></span><div class="tp-inner"><p class="tp-eyebrow">A GOOD PLACE TO BEGIN</p><h2 id="make-title">One tool. Three starting points.</h2><div class="tp-lesson" data-tp-player><div class="tp-lesson-toolbar" data-tp-controls hidden><label for="project-picker">Project</label><select id="project-picker" data-tp-picker><option value="0">A cover-art loop</option><option value="1">A silent Canvas candidate</option><option value="2">A social announcement</option></select><div class="tp-cycle"><button type="button" data-tp-previous aria-label="Previous project" title="Previous project"><svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg></button><span data-tp-count role="status" aria-live="polite">1 / 3</span><button type="button" data-tp-next aria-label="Next project" title="Next project"><svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg></button></div></div><div class="tp-lesson-content"><article data-tp-lesson aria-labelledby="lesson-0"><h3 id="lesson-0">A cover-art loop</h3><p>Build a moving companion to an album cover.</p><ol><li>Import your track and square cover artwork.</li><li>Compare scenes, choose a palette and adjust kick sensitivity.</li><li>Export a short loop and inspect both the movement and the loop boundary.</li></ol></article><article data-tp-lesson hidden aria-labelledby="lesson-1"><h3 id="lesson-1">A silent Canvas candidate</h3><p>Prepare a loop for a separate platform-upload check.</p><ol><li>Pick a downbeat and a short section that loops well.</li><li>Keep text and artwork legible in the vertical composition.</li><li>Export silent MP4 if available, then verify Spotify&#x27;s current requirements separately.</li></ol></article><article data-tp-lesson hidden aria-labelledby="lesson-2"><h3 id="lesson-2">A social announcement</h3><p>Combine a track excerpt with a moving visual.</p><ol><li>Add the track, artwork and artist/title text.</li><li>Preview readability and choose whether to include audio.</li><li>Keep the tab visible during export and check the downloaded video.</li></ol></article></div><div class="tp-lesson-footer"><a class="tp-primary" href="https://sattarimusic.com/studio/canvas" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Make it in Canvas <svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"/><path d="M10 14 21 3"/><path d="M21 14v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5"/></svg></a></div></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-band" id="exports" aria-labelledby="exports-title"><div class="tp-inner tp-export-layout"><div><p class="tp-eyebrow">YOUR WORK, TO KEEP</p><h2 id="exports-title">Take the result with you.</h2><p>Download the finished video and keep your source artwork and audio. Review the file before publishing it elsewhere.</p></div><dl class="tp-exports"><div><dt>MP4 / WebM</dt><dd>MP4 where supported; other browsers may offer WebM only.</dd></div><div><dt>Still image</dt><dd>Keep a frame from the composition.</dd></div><div><dt>Silent or with audio</dt><dd>Choose for the destination; no automatic Spotify publishing.</dd></div></dl></div></section>
 <section class="tp-band tp-notes" id="limits" aria-labelledby="limits-title"><div class="tp-inner tp-note-layout"><div><p class="tp-eyebrow">BUILDING IN PUBLIC</p><h2 id="limits-title">An alpha. An invitation.</h2><p>Try it, make something, and tell us what needs to work better.</p><a class="tp-feedback" href="/testing/?product=canvas#feedback">Send Canvas feedback <svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"/><path d="M10 14 21 3"/><path d="M21 14v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5"/></svg></a></div><div class="tp-questions"><details open><summary>What should I know before starting?</summary><p>Recording is real-time and needs the tab visible. Browser encoders vary. Loop boundaries have no crossfade, and kick detection can miss or double-count beats. A downloaded file is not a guarantee of platform acceptance.</p></details><details><summary>How do I keep my work?</summary><p>Download the finished video and keep your source artwork and audio. Review the file before publishing it elsewhere.</p></details><details><summary>Can I download a native app?</summary><p>This page opens the public web alpha. There are no public native downloads yet. <a href="/downloads/">Check current availability.</a></p></details></div></div></section>
