 <section class="tp-band" id="what-it-does" aria-labelledby="features-title"><div class="tp-inner"><p class="tp-eyebrow">FROM IDEA TO OUTPUT</p><h2 id="features-title">Make it your own.</h2><div class="tp-features"><div class="tp-feature"><span class="tp-number">01</span><h3>Words you can correct</h3><p>Edit the transcript instead of accepting every model prediction.</p></div><div class="tp-feature"><span class="tp-number">02</span><h3>A style for the story</h3><p>Compare five animated caption styles and adjust line length.</p></div><div class="tp-feature"><span class="tp-number">03</span><h3>Subtitles that travel</h3><p>Export SRT or VTT separately from the burned-in video.</p></div></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-band tp-making" id="make" aria-labelledby="make-title"><span id="how-it-works"></span><div class="tp-inner"><p class="tp-eyebrow">A GOOD PLACE TO BEGIN</p><h2 id="make-title">One tool. Three starting points.</h2><div class="tp-lesson" data-tp-player><div class="tp-lesson-toolbar" data-tp-controls hidden><label for="project-picker">Project</label><select id="project-picker" data-tp-picker><option value="0">A founder introduction</option><option value="1">An audio-only announcement</option><option value="2">Restyle existing subtitles</option></select><div class="tp-cycle"><button type="button" data-tp-previous aria-label="Previous project" title="Previous project"><svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg></button><span data-tp-count role="status" aria-live="polite">1 / 3</span><button type="button" data-tp-next aria-label="Next project" title="Next project"><svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg></button></div></div><div class="tp-lesson-content"><article data-tp-lesson aria-labelledby="lesson-0"><h3 id="lesson-0">A founder introduction</h3><p>Make a short spoken introduction easier to follow.</p><ol><li>Import a short video with clear speech, or use an existing SRT/VTT file.</li><li>Review names and punctuation, then choose a readable caption style.</li><li>Export the subtitle file and, if needed, a burned-in WebM.</li></ol></article><article data-tp-lesson hidden aria-labelledby="lesson-1"><h3 id="lesson-1">An audio-only announcement</h3><p>Give a voice note a visual format.</p><ol><li>Import an audio clip and check the transcript.</li><li>Choose an audiogram aspect ratio and adjust caption grouping.</li><li>Keep the tab visible during the real-time video export.</li></ol></article><article data-tp-lesson hidden aria-labelledby="lesson-2"><h3 id="lesson-2">Restyle existing subtitles</h3><p>Try a new presentation without retranscribing the clip.</p><ol><li>Import your SRT or VTT alongside the matching media.</li><li>Compare styles and check contrast against the footage.</li><li>Export updated subtitles or a styled WebM, then review the result.</li></ol></article></div><div class="tp-lesson-footer"><a class="tp-primary" href="https://scenepilot.thecreatingco.com/tools/captions/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Make it in Captions <svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"/><path d="M10 14 21 3"/><path d="M21 14v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5"/></svg></a></div></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-band" id="exports" aria-labelledby="exports-title"><div class="tp-inner tp-export-layout"><div><p class="tp-eyebrow">YOUR WORK, TO KEEP</p><h2 id="exports-title">Take the result with you.</h2><p>Download SRT/VTT to preserve the edited words and timings. Keep the original clip and inspect the exported video.</p></div><dl class="tp-exports"><div><dt>WebM</dt><dd>Animated captions burned into a video; no MP4 export currently.</dd></div><div><dt>SRT / VTT</dt><dd>Editable subtitle files for other tools.</dd></div><div><dt>ScenePilot handoff</dt><dd>Per-line titles, not word-by-word animation.</dd></div></dl></div></section>
 <section class="tp-band tp-notes" id="limits" aria-labelledby="limits-title"><div class="tp-inner tp-note-layout"><div><p class="tp-eyebrow">BUILDING IN PUBLIC</p><h2 id="limits-title">An alpha. An invitation.</h2><p>Try it, make something, and tell us what needs to work better.</p><a class="tp-feedback" href="/testing/?product=captions#feedback">Send Captions feedback <svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"/><path d="M10 14 21 3"/><path d="M21 14v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5"/></svg></a></div><div class="tp-questions"><details open><summary>What should I know before starting?</summary><p>The on-device speech model can mishear names, accents and sung lyrics. Review every transcript. Burn-in runs in real time with the tab visible. Translation, dubbing and universal language accuracy are not promised.</p></details><details><summary>How do I keep my work?</summary><p>Download SRT/VTT to preserve the edited words and timings. Keep the original clip and inspect the exported video.</p></details><details><summary>Can I download a native app?</summary><p>This page opens the public web alpha. There are no public native downloads yet. <a href="/downloads/">Check current availability.</a></p></details></div></div></section>
