nd image options." loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="1000"><figcaption>Ghost Studio export panel showing project and image options.</figcaption></figure></div><nav class="tcc-story-controls" data-story-controls role="tablist" aria-label="Ghost Studio visual tour" hidden></nav></div><div class="tcc-story-copy"><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">01 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 04</p><h3>Start with references</h3><p>Bring reference images into a garment study before shaping the model.</p></article><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">02 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 04</p><h3>Shape the silhouette</h3><p>Adjust the garment and inspect how it sits on the mannequin.</p></article><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">03 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 04</p><h3>Check another view</h3><p>Rotate the model to inspect it from another angle.</p></article><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">04 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 04</p><h3>Choose what to keep</h3><p>Review available project and image outputs for the current edition.</p></article><p class="tcc-story-status tcc-story-sr-only" data-story-status role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p></div></div></section><!-- PRODUCT-REFRESH:START --><section class="mini-player" id="product-lessons" data-mini-product="ghost" aria-label="Ghost Studio mini lessons"><div class="mini-heading"><h2>Explore a garment.</h2></div><div class="mini-controls" role="group" aria-label="Lesson navigation"><label for="mini-lesson-ghost">Choose a lesson</label><button type="button" data-mini-cycle="previous" aria-label="Previous lesson" title="Previous lesson"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg></button><select id="mini-lesson-ghost" data-mini-select><option value="silhouette" data-src="/learn/product-try/ghost/?miniLesson=silhouette" data-poster="/assets/workflows/ghost-compare.png" data-description="Compare the two captured garment studies.">Compare the silhouette</option><option value="detail" data-src="/learn/product-try/ghost/?miniLesson=detail" data-poster="/assets/workflows/ghost-compare.png" data-description="Compare sleeves, hems and drape in the captured study.">Inspect the garment details</option></select><button type="button" data-mini-cycle="next" aria-label="Next lesson" title="Next lesson"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></button><p class="mini-count" data-mini-count role="status" aria-live="polite">Lesson 1 of 2</p></div><div class="mini-box"><header class="mini-bar"><h3 data-mini-title>Compare the silhouette</h3><button type="button" data-mini-expand aria-label="Expand lesson" title="Expand lesson"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></header><div class="mini-stage" data-mini-stage><img data-mini-poster src="/assets/workflows/ghost-compare.png" alt="Compare the silhouette product example" loading="lazy"><button type="button" data-mini-open>Open lesson</button></div><footer class="mini-footer"><p data-mini-description>Compare the two captured garment studies.</p><p role="status" data-mini-status></p><a data-mini-full href="/learn/product-try/ghost/?miniLesson=silhouette">Continue this lesson</a></footer></div></section><!-- PRODUCT-REFRESH:END --><div class="section" style="padding-block:0"></div><!-- PRODUCT-EXAMPLES:START --><!-- PRODUCT-LESSONS:START --><!-- PRODUCT-LESSONS:END --><!-- PRODUCT-EXAMPLES:END --><!-- PRODUCT-FEATURES:START --><section class="pf" id="product-features" aria-labelledby="pf-title" data-product-features="ghost" style="--pf-accent:#a2ead6"><div class="pf-intro"><div><p class="pf-eyebrow">INSIDE GHOST STUDIO</p><h2 id="pf-title">What Ghost Studio can do.</h2><p class="pf-lede">Turn photo references into adjustable 3D garment and object studies.</p></div><p class="pf-total"><strong>19</strong><span>features to explore</span></p></div><aside class="pf-scope" aria-label="Edition and availability"><p><strong>Explore the tools, workflows and current scope of the product.</strong> These are assisted visual approximations. Ghost does not recover exact sewing patterns, measured fit, or unseen construction from photographs.</p></aside><div class="pr-search"><label for="pr-feature-search">Find a capability</label><input id="pr-feature-search" type="search" data-pr-search placeholder="Search tools, workflows or editions" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="pr-feature-status"><p id="pr-feature-status" data-pr-search-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><nav class="pf-jump" aria-label="Feature categories"><a href="#pf-ghost-1">Prepare the references</a><a href="#pf-ghost-2">Shape the garment</a><a href="#pf-ghost-3">Build &amp; inspect the model</a><a href="#pf-ghost-4">Batch, export &amp; recover</a></nav><details class="pf-group" id="pf-ghost-1"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Prepare the references</h3><span class="pf-group-count">6 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Photo collections</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Import multiple PNG, JPEG, or WebP references and organize them into individual items.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Reference pairing</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Suggest front/back pairs from filenames or simple visual properties, then let the user confirm, swap, or reassign them.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Photo preparation</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Crop, rotate, straighten, correct planar perspective, and gently balance broad shadows.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Background cleanup</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Connected-color removal, erase/restore brushes, undo, and reset.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Precise manual cutouts</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Trace a subject and cut interior openings while preserving the original image.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Garment categories</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Support a broad range of tops, outerwear, dresses, trousers, skirts, swimwear, draped pieces, and custom silhouettes.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-ghost-2"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Shape the garment</h3><span class="pf-group-count">4 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Fitted garment construction</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Adjustable body and sleeve panels, collars, open necks, and inferred cloth hoods for supported categories.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Presentation choices</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Show garments on an invisible mannequin or a hanger.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Drape controls</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Adjust stiffness, fabric preset, fullness, airflow, scale, and supported proportion controls.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Real cloth simulation</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Run the local cloth solver and replay supported drape simulations.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-ghost-3"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Build &amp; inspect the model</h3><span class="pf-group-count">5 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Photo Match</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Overlay the mesh on its reference and adjust cross-sections; an optional side reference guides estimated depth.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Object construction</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Thirteen categories, including chairs, phones, cars, buildings, toys/custom objects, tables, sofas, lamps, bottles, vases, bowls, and mugs.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Individual object parts</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Change visibility, dimensions, position, and rotation while retaining photo textures.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Surface finish</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Adjust roughness and metallic response.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Review tools</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Rotate through 360°, compare references, and review inferred depth, coverage, strain, and corrections.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-ghost-4"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>Batch, export &amp; recover</h3><span class="pf-group-count">4 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Batch generation</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Process confirmed items with progress, stop/resume behavior, and per-item errors.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Exports</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Embedded-texture GLB models, PNG images, and ZIP collections with model manifests.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Editable projects</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Save and reopen garment projects and `.ghostbatch` collections containing references and settings.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Recovery and offline use</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Browser-local recovery drafts and an installable web experience.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details></section><!-- PRODUCT-FEATURES:END --><!-- AFTER-HOURS:ghost:START --><section class="ah" id="after-hours-ghost" data-after-hours="ghost" style="--ah-accent:#2b6049"><p class="ah-eyebrow">AFTER HOURS / Ghost Studio / Web studio</p><h2>Two references. A form to explore.</h2><p class="ah-deck">Bring a coherent front and back pair into a new collection, change the silhouette, and inspect the resulting jacket from both sides.</p><div class="ah-chapters" role="tablist" aria-label="Sculptural Jacket Study chapters"><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-ghost-tab-0" aria-controls="after-hours-ghost-panel-0" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0"><span>01</span>Start with both sides</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-ghost-tab-1" aria-controls="after-hours-ghost-panel-1" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>02</span>Give the silhouette room</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-ghost-tab-2" aria-controls="after-hours-ghost-panel-2" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>03</span>Look behind the form</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-ghost-tab-3" aria-controls="after-hours-ghost-panel-3" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>04</span>Keep the model and its source</button></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-ghost-panel-0" aria-labelledby="after-hours-ghost-tab-0" ><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/ghost-01-references.png" alt="Ghost Studio: Start with both sides. An original AI-generated front and back pair establishes the midnight-blue jacket and amber collar. The source comparison keeps both references available." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Start with both sides</h3><p>An original AI-generated front and back pair establishes the midnight-blue jacket and amber collar. The source comparison keeps both references available.</p></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-ghost-panel-1" aria-labelledby="after-hours-ghost-tab-1" hidden><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/ghost-02-relaxed.png" alt="Ghost Studio: Give the silhouette room. Changing Natural to Relaxed produces a broader form. The wool setting and stiffness of 50 remain in place while the app settles the drape." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Give the silhouette room</h3><p>Changing Natural to Relaxed produces a broader form. The wool setting and stiffness of 50 remain in place while the app settles the drape.</p></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-ghost-panel-2" aria-labelledby="after-hours-ghost-tab-2" hidden><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/ghost-03-back.png" alt="Ghost Studio: Look behind the form. The rear view exposes the back construction beside the supplied reference. The result remains an estimated visual study." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Look behind the form</h3><p>The rear view exposes the back construction beside the supplied reference. The result remains an estimated visual study.</p></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-ghost-panel-3" aria-labelledby="after-hours-ghost-tab-3" hidden><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/ghost-04-export.png" alt="Ghost Studio: Keep the model and its source. The selected jacket exported to a textured GLB. The editable collection also retains the two original reference images and relaxed settings." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Keep the model and its source</h3><p>The selected jacket exported to a textured GLB. The editable collection also retains the two original reference images and relaxed settings.</p></div></div><p class="ah-count" data-ah-count role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="ah-actions"><a class="ah-primary" href="https://ghost.thecreatingco.com/">Open Ghost Studio ↗</a><button type="button" data-ah-expand>Inspect the screenshot</button></div><div class="ah-actions"><a href="/assets/after-hours/outputs/after-hours-jacket.glb" download>Download the jacket GLB</a><a href="/assets/after-hours/outputs/after-hours-jacket-study.ghostbatch" download>Download the editable collection</a></div><p class="ah-note">Actual browser session. The GLB contains five meshes; the editable archive passed integrity checks and its two images match the originals. The model has visibly stepped outline edges. Unseen sides and dimensions are estimates; this is not sewing-pattern or fit validation.</p><dialog aria-labelledby="after-hours-ghost-dialog-title"><button type="button" autofocus>Close screenshot</button><p id="after-hours-ghost-dialog-title" data-ah-dialog-title></p><img alt=""></dialog></section><!-- AFTER-HOURS:ghost:END --><section class="scope-section section" id="browser"><div><p class="overline">YOUR BROWSER EDITION</p><h2>Your web edition.</h2><p>Add photos, adjust a garment or object study, and export a GLB or editable project using the real Ghost web app.</p><details open><summary>Current limitations</summary><p>Local silhouette and template methods create visual approximations. They do not recover exact patterns or calibrated fit. Recovery belongs to this browser; export a portable backup.</p></details></div><div class="try-card"><h3>One good first test</h3><ol><li><span>01</span>Add your own front and back references.</li><li><span>02</span>Refine the shape and photo alignment.</li><li><span>03</span>Export GLB and an editable project.</li></ol><a class="button accent primary-app" href="https://ghost.thecreatingco.com/">Open the browser app</a><a href="/testing/?product=ghost#feedback">Send feedback</a></div></section><!-- PRODUCT-NEXT:START --><section class="pr-next" aria-labelledby="pr-next-title"><p class="pr-kicker">OTHER APPS FROM THECREATECO</p><h2 id="pr-next-title">More room for your curiosity.</h2><div class="pr-cards"><a class="pr-card" href="/products/librarian/" style="--pr-tone:#83d7ff"><h3>Librarian</h3><p>Keep the ideas you want to return to.</p><span class="pr-card-label">Explore the product<b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a><a class="pr-c