"#how-it-works">See how it works</a></div><p class="ph-scope">Web studio · drawn letterforms, not a font-engineering tool</p><p class="other-app-status">Public alpha · <a href="#limits">Availability &amp; current scope</a> · <a href="/testing/?product=glyph-studio#feedback">Send feedback</a></p></div></section><section class="section prose" id="what-it-does"><p class="overline">WHAT IT DOES</p><h2>Draw letterforms, export a working font.</h2><p>Draw each glyph with a brush or pen, and Glyph Studio fits a smooth curve to your strokes. Set up kerning pairs and check metrics, then try the result in the built-in type tester. Projects save and load as <code>.glyph</code> files, with autosave to this browser's storage, and the finished font exports as OTF or TTF &mdash; or opens directly back in Luma Studio's type tool.</p></section><section class="section prose" id="how-it-works"><p class="overline">HOW IT WORKS</p><h2>Three steps to a working font.</h2><ol class="launch-roadmap"><li><span>01</span><h3>Draw your glyphs.</h3><p>Use the brush or pen tool to draw each letterform; curves are fit automatically.</p></li><li><span>02</span><h3>Set kerning and check metrics.</h3><p>Adjust spacing between letter pairs and try the result in the type tester.</p></li><li><span>03</span><h3>Export or send to Luma.</h3><p>Export OTF/TTF, or open the font directly in Luma Studio's type tool.</p></li></ol></section><section class="scope-section section" id="limits"><div><p class="overline">HONEST LIMITS</p><h2>What Glyph Studio doesn't do.</h2><details open><summary>Current limitations</summary><p>Kerning currently exports to TTF only, not OTF &mdash; the underlying library (opentype.js) has no GPOS/kern table writer yet. This is a public web alpha; projects autosave to this browser's storage, which is not an account backup, so keep an exported copy of work you want to keep.</p></details></div><div class="try-card"><h3>One good first test</h3><ol><li><span>01</span>Draw a few letters with the pen tool.</li><li><span>02</span>Adjust kerning between two letters.</li><li><span>03</span>Export TTF and try it in the type tester.</li></ol><a class="button accent primary-app" href="https://glyph-studio-610.netlify.app">Open Glyph Studio</a><a href="/testing/?product=glyph-studio#feedback">Send feedback</a></div></section><section class="pr-next" aria-labelledby="pr-next-title"><p class="pr-kicker">OTHER APPS FROM THECREATECO</p><h2 id="pr-next-title">More room for your curiosity.</h2><div class="pr-cards"><a class="pr-card" href="/products/luma/" style="--pr-tone:#ff83ba"><h3>Luma Studio</h3><p>Your images. Your world.</p><span class="pr-card-label">Explore the product<b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a><a class="pr-card" href="/products/ghost/" style="--pr-tone:#a2ead6"><h3>Ghost Studio</h3><p>See your references in another dimension.</p><span class="pr-card-label">Explore the product<b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a><a class="pr-card" href="/products/librarian/" style="--pr-tone:#83d7ff"><h3>Librarian</h3><p>Keep the ideas you want to return to.</p><span class="pr-card-label">Explore the product<b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a></div></section></main><footer class="mm-footer"><div><a class="wordmark" href="/">thecreateco.</a><p>For whatever you’re into next. <a class="brand-domain" href="https://thecreatingco.com/">thecreatingco.com</a></p></div><nav aria-label="Footer"><a href="/#creative-suite">Creative Suite</a><a href="/#other-apps">Other apps</a><a href="/learn/">Learning library</a><a href="/testing/">Testing &amp; feedback</a><a href="/downloads/">Release status</a><a href="/about/">About thecreateco</a><a href="/privacy/">Data &amp; privacy</a><a href="/work/">Your work</a><a href="/community/network">Community</a><a href="/kickstarter/">Kickstarter &amp; launch list ↗</a></nav><small>Independent creative tools · Public testing editions</small></footer><dialog class="mm-launch-dialog" aria-labelledby="mm-launch-title"><div class="mm-d