+<link rel="stylesheet" href="/app-logos.css?v=2"><script defer src="/app-logos.js?v=2"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/product-story.css?v=20261009"><script src="/product-story.js?v=20261009" defer></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/unified-shell.css?v=20261009"></head><body style="--accent:#fff3c2;--pr-tone:#ffe066" class="presentation-page presentation-glyph-studio momentium-shell mm-polished pr-page site-refined site-unified"><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="header mm-header cc-header"><a class="wordmark" href="/start/" aria-label="thecreateco home">thecreateco<span class="brand-period">.</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a data-nav-key="suite" href="/#creative-suite">Creative Suite</a><a data-nav-key="apps" href="/tools/">Apps &amp; tools</a><a data-nav-key="about" href="/about/">About</a><a data-nav-key="learn" href="/learn/">Learn</a><a data-nav-key="circle" href="/community/network">The Circle</a></nav><div class="cc-header-actions"><button class="mm-launch-button" type="button" data-mm-launch aria-label="Quick launch">Quick launch</button><details class="site-menu" data-site-menu><summary aria-label="Site menu" title="Site menu"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></summary><nav aria-label="Site menu"><a data-nav-key="suite" href="/#creative-suite">Creative Suite</a><a data-nav-key="apps" href="/tools/">Apps &amp; tools</a><a data-nav-key="learn" href="/learn/">Learn</a><a data-nav-key="locker" href="/locker/">Locker</a><a data-nav-key="work" href="/work/">Saved lessons</a><a data-nav-key="start" href="/start/">Meet thecreateco</a><a data-nav-key="about" href="/about/">About</a><a data-nav-key="circle" href="/community/network">The Circle</a><a data-nav-key="store" href="https://momentous-store.netlify.app/">Momentous store</a><a data-nav-key="launch" href="/kickstarter/">Kickstarter plans</a><a data-nav-key="downloads" href="/downloads/">Downloads &amp; availability</a><a data-nav-key="support" href="/testing/">Support &amp; feedback</a><a data-nav-key="releases" href="/release-notes/">Release notes</a><a data-nav-key="privacy" href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></nav></details></div></header><main id="main" tabindex="-1"><nav class="pr-nav product-polish-nav" aria-label="On this product page"><span>Glyph Studio</span><div class="pr-nav-links"><a href="#what-it-does">What it does</a><a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a><a class="product-open-link" href="https://glyph-studio-610.netlify.app">Open app <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></nav><section class="ph" id="top" data-product-hero="glyph-studio"><div class="ph-copy"><p class="product-family" data-product-family="other-apps"><a href="/#other-apps">Other apps from thecreateco</a></p><p class="ph-label">Web studio / OPEN FOR EXPLORATION</p><h1>Glyph Studio</h1><p class="ph-promise">Draw your own font, right in the browser.</p><p class="ph-description">Glyph Studio is a standalone draw-your-own-font tool, spun out of Luma Studio's Glyph feature into its own app with a decoupled engine. Brush and pen drawing, smooth curve fitting, a kerning-pairs editor, metrics, a type tester, and OTF/TTF export, with an Open in Luma link.</p><div class="ph-actions"><a class="ph-open" href="https://glyph-studio-610.netlify.app">Open Glyph Studio</a><a href="#how-it-works">See how it works</a></div><p class="ph-scope">Web studio · drawn letterforms, not a font-engineering tool</p><p class="other-app-status">Public alpha · <a href="#limits">Availability &amp; current scope</a> · <a href="/testing/?product=glyph-studio#feedback">Send feedback</a></p></div></section><section class="tcc-product-story" data-product-story="glyph-studio" style="--story-accent:#ff8d61" aria-labelledby="product-story-glyph-studio-title"><div class="tcc-story-heading"><p class="tcc-story-kicker">A VISUAL TOUR · GLYPH STUDIO</p><h2 id="product-story-glyph-studio-title">The work, as it comes together.</h2><p>Explore a browser font-making workspace and a few characters in context. The second image is promotional artwork, not an exported font.</p></div><div class="tcc-story-layout"><div class="tcc-story-visual" data-story-visual><div class="tcc-story-frames"><figure class="tcc-story-frame" id="product-story-glyph-studio-1" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" data-story-frame><img src="/assets/creative-tools/glyph-studio.webp" alt="Glyph Studio public alpha page showing the browser editor and example characters." loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="1000"><figcaption>Glyph Studio public alpha page showing the browser editor and example characters.</figcaption></figure><figure class="tcc-story-frame" id="product-story-glyph-studio-2" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" data-story-frame><img src="/assets/share/glyph-studio.jpg" alt="Promotional identity artwork for Glyph Studio, not an exported font." loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="1000"><figcaption>Promotional identity artwork for Glyph Studio, not an exported font.</figcaption></figure></div><nav class="tcc-story-controls" data-story-controls role="tablist" aria-label="Glyph Studio visual tour" hidden></nav></div><div class="tcc-story-copy"><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">01 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 02</p><h3>Start with letterforms</h3><p>Explore the browser editor and see the characters in a sample workspace.</p></article><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">02 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 02</p><h3>See the idea in context</h3><p>Review the Glyph Studio visual identity; this artwork is not a downloadable font specimen.</p></article><p class="tcc-story-status tcc-story-sr-only" data-story-status role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p></div></div></section><section class="section prose" id="what-it-does"><p class="overline">WHAT IT DOES</p><h2>Draw letterforms, export a working font.</h2><p>Draw each glyph with a brush or pen, and Glyph Studio fits a smooth curve to your strokes. Set up kerning pairs and check metrics, then try the result in the built-in type tester. Projects save and load as <code>.glyph</code> files, with autosave to this browser's storage, and the finished font exports as OTF or TTF &mdash; or opens directly back in Luma Studio's type tool.</p></section><section class="section prose" id="how-it-works"><p class="overline">HOW IT WORKS</p><h2>Three steps to a working font.</h2><ol class="launch-roadmap"><li><span>01</span><h3>Draw your glyphs.</h3><p>Use the brush or pen tool to draw each letterform; curves are fit automatically.</p></li><li><span>02</span><h3>Set kerning and check metrics.</h3><p>Adjust spacing between letter pairs and try the result in the type tester.</p></li><li><span>03</span><h3>Export or send to Luma.</h3><p>Export OTF/TTF, or open the font directly in Luma Studio's type tool.</p></li></ol></section><section class="scope-section section" id="limits"><div><p class="overline">HONEST LIMITS</p><h2>What Glyph Studio doesn't do.</h2><details open><summary>Current limitations</summary><p>Kerning currently exports to TTF only, not OTF &mdash; the underlying library (opentype.js) has no GPOS/kern table writer yet. This is a public web alpha; projects autosave to this browser's storage, which is not an account backup, so keep an exported copy of work you want to keep.</p></details></div><div class="try-card"><h3>One good first test</h3><ol><li><span>01</span>Draw a few letters with the pen tool.</li><li><span>02</span>Adjust kerning between two letters.</li><li><span>03</span>Export TTF and try it in the type tester.</li></ol><a class="button accent primary-app" href="https://glyph-studio-610.netlify.app">Open Glyph Studio</a><a href="/testing/?product=glyph-studio#feedback">Send feedback</a></div></section><section class="pr-next" aria-labelledby="pr-next-title"><p class="pr-kicker">OTHER APPS FROM THECREATECO</p><h2 id="pr-next-title">More room for your curiosity.</h2><div class="pr-cards"><a class="pr-card" href="/products/luma/" style="--pr-tone:#ff83ba"><h3>Luma Studio</h3><p>Your images. Your world.</p><span class="pr-card-label">Explore the product<b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a><a class="pr-card" href="/products/ghost/" style="--pr-tone:#a2ead6"><h3>Ghost Studio</h3><p>See your references in another dimension.</p><span class="pr-card-label">Explore the product<b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a><a class="pr-card" href="/products/librarian/" style="--pr-tone:#83d7ff"><h3>Librarian</h3><p>Keep the ideas you want to return to.</p><span class="pr-card-label">Explore the product<b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a></div></section></main><footer class="mm-footer cc-footer"><div><a class="wordmark" href="/start/">thecreateco.</a><p>For whatever you are into next.</p></div><nav aria-label="Footer"><section aria-labelledby="footer-0"><h2 id="footer-0">Create</h2><a data-nav-key="suite" href="/#creative-suite">Creative Suite</a><a data-nav-key="apps" href="/tools/">Apps &amp; tools</a><a data-nav-key="learn" href="/learn/">Learn</a><a data-nav-key="locker" href="/locker/">Locker</a><a data-nav-key="work" href="/work/">Saved lessons</a></section><section aria-labelledby="footer-1"><h2 id="footer-1">Connect</h2><a data-nav-key="start" href="/start/">Meet thecreateco</a><a data-nav-key="about" href="/about/">About</a><a data-nav-key="circle" href="/community/network">The Circle</a><a data-nav-key="store" href="https://momentous-store.netlify.app/">Momentous store</a><a data-nav-key="launch" href="/kickstarter/">Kickstarter plans</a></section><section aria-labelledby="footer-2"><h2 id="footer-2">Help</h2><a data-nav