d a shelf around one idea and settle into a reading view that suits you.</p><div class="ph-actions"><a class="ph-open" href="https://librarian.thecreatingco.com/">Open Librarian</a><a href="#product-lessons">Try the reading workspace</a></div><p class="ph-scope">Web library · local PDF reading</p><!-- ALPHA-ACCESS:START --><p class="other-app-status">Public alpha · <a href="#browser">Availability &amp; current scope</a> · <a href="/testing/?product=librarian#feedback">Send feedback</a></p><!-- ALPHA-ACCESS:END --></div><div class="ph-media"><figure class="other-app-hero other-app-librarian"><a href="#product-lessons" aria-label="Try Librarian"><img src="/assets/workflows/librarian-library.png" alt="Import original PDFs and return to them from the library. Build a personal shelf" width="1710" height="1069" fetchpriority="high"></a></figure></div></section><!-- PRODUCT-REFRESH:START --><section class="mini-player" id="product-lessons" data-mini-product="librarian" aria-label="Librarian mini lessons"><div class="mini-heading"><h2>Build your reading space.</h2></div><div class="mini-controls" role="group" aria-label="Lesson navigation"><label for="mini-lesson-librarian">Choose a lesson</label><button type="button" data-mini-cycle="previous" aria-label="Previous lesson" title="Previous lesson"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg></button><select id="mini-lesson-librarian" data-mini-select><option value="field" data-src="/learn/product-try/librarian/?miniLesson=field" data-poster="/assets/workflows/librarian-reading.png" data-description="Explore and download the original Field notes PDF.">Read your field notes</option><option value="materials" data-src="/learn/product-try/librarian/?miniLesson=materials" data-poster="/assets/workflows/librarian-reading.png" data-description="Explore and download Materials &amp; sound.">Build a materials reference</option></select><button type="button" data-mini-cycle="next" aria-label="Next lesson" title="Next lesson"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></button><p class="mini-count" data-mini-count role="status" aria-live="polite">Lesson 1 of 2</p></div><div class="mini-box"><header class="mini-bar"><h3 data-mini-title>Read your field notes</h3><button type="button" data-mini-expand aria-label="Expand lesson" title="Expand lesson"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></header><div class="mini-stage" data-mini-stage><img data-mini-poster src="/assets/workflows/librarian-reading.png" alt="Read your field notes product example" loading="lazy"><button type="button" data-mini-open>Open lesson</button></div><footer class="mini-footer"><p data-mini-description>Explore and download the original Field notes PDF.</p><p role="status" data-mini-status></p><a data-mini-full href="/learn/product-try/librarian/?miniLesson=field">Continue this lesson</a></footer></div></section><!-- PRODUCT-REFRESH:END --><div class="section" style="padding-block:0"></div><!-- PRODUCT-EXAMPLES:START --><!-- PRODUCT-LESSONS:START --><!-- PRODUCT-LESSONS:END --><!-- PRODUCT-EXAMPLES:END --><!-- PRODUCT-FEATURES:START --><section class="pf" id="product-features" aria-labelledby="pf-title" data-product-features="librarian" style="--pf-accent:#83d7ff"><div class="pf-intro"><div><p class="pf-eyebrow">INSIDE LIBRARIAN</p><h2 id="pf-title">What Librarian can do.</h2><p class="pf-lede">Discover books across catalogs, build a personal shelf, and read your PDFs.</p></div><p class="pf-total"><strong>16</strong><span>features to explore</span></p></div><aside class="pf-scope" aria-label="Edition and availability"><p><strong>Explore the tools, workflows and current scope of the product.</strong> Catalogs and AI require available online services. Imported PDFs can be read locally; EPUB links are not a built-in EPUB reader, and catalog records do not guarantee full-text access.</p></aside><div class="pr-search"><label for="pr-feature-search">Find a capability</label><input id="pr-feature-search" type="search" data-pr-search placeholder="Search tools, workflows or editions" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="pr-feature-status"><p id="pr-feature-status" data-pr-search-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><nav class="pf-jump" aria-label="Feature categories"><a href="#pf-librarian-1">Discover across catalogs</a><a href="#pf-librarian-2">Explore records &amp; access</a><a href="#pf-librarian-3">Build a shelf &amp; read</a></nav><details class="pf-group" id="pf-librarian-1"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Discover across catalogs</h3><span class="pf-group-count">5 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Federated discovery</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Search 15 configured catalog integrations from one query.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Broad source coverage</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Open Library, Google Books, Gutenberg, OpenAlex, Crossref, Internet Archive, CORE, DPLA, Europeana, K10plus, Library of Congress, BnF, DNB, Finna, and Norway’s National Library.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Flexible search</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Search titles, authors, subjects, and ISBNs.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Duplicate merging</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Combine matching records using ISBNs and title/author similarity.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Ranked results</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Consider query relevance, metadata completeness, and coverage across catalogs.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-librarian-2"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Explore records &amp; access</h3><span class="pf-group-count">6 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Rich result cards</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Covers, authors, categories, publication information, page counts, availability, and source badges.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Filtering</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Narrow by source, language, and availability.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Source controls</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Enable or disable catalog sources and inspect source information.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Detailed records</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Read descriptions, subjects, identifiers, provenance, and original catalog links.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Edition discovery</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Expand available Open Library editions.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Access links</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Follow supported preview, public-domain, download, borrowing, and library-finding links.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-librarian-3"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Build a shelf &amp; read</h3><span class="pf-group-count">5 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Personal shelf</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Save and remove books locally and return to a working collection.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>PDF library</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Import multiple PDFs or save accessible linked PDFs into the library.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Built-in reading</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Read stored PDFs, adjust zoom, and switch reading presentation between light, warm, and dark settings.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Offline PDF access</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Return to locally stored imported documents.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>AI recommendations</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Ask questions about search results and receive recommendations grounded in those results and shelf context.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details></section><!-- PRODUCT-FEATURES:END --><!-- AFTER-HOURS:librarian:START --><section class="ah" id="after-hours-librarian" data-after-hours="librarian" style="--ah-accent:#785329"><p class="ah-eyebrow">AFTER HOURS / Librarian / Web library</p><h2>Keep the ideas close.</h2><p class="ah-deck">Two original research documents become a small browser library. Move from the brief to its sound palette, adjust the reading view, and return after a reload.</p><div class="ah-chapters" role="tablist" aria-label="Exhibition Research Shelf chapters"><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-librarian-tab-0" aria-controls="after-hours-librarian-panel-0" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0"><span>01</span>Open the exhibition brief</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-librarian-tab-1" aria-controls="after-hours-librarian-panel-1" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>02</span>Follow the sound</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-librarian-tab-2" aria-controls="after-hours-librarian-panel-2" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>03</span>Change the reading light</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-librarian-tab-3" aria-controls="after-hours-librarian-panel-3" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>04</span>Return to the shelf</button></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-librarian-panel-0" aria-labelledby="after-hours-librarian-tab-0" ><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/librarian-01-field-notes.png" alt="Librarian: Open the exhibition brief. After Hours Field Notes and Materials and Sound were imported as original PDFs. The field notes open in a light reading view at 67% zoom." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Open the exhibition brief</h3><p>After Hours Field Notes and Materials and Sound were imported as original PDFs. The field notes open in a light reading view at 67% zoom.</p></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-librarian-panel-1" aria-labelledby="after-hours-librarian-tab-1" hidden><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/librarian-02-sound-palette.png" alt="Librarian: Follow the sound. Pages five and six connect four measured waveform diagrams with the project handoff. The reader keeps the illustrated spread together." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Follow the sound</h3><p>Pages five and six connect four measured waveform diagrams with the project handoff. The reader keeps the illustrated spread together.</p></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-librarian-panel-2" aria-labelledby="after-hours-librarian-tab-2" hidden><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/librarian-03-dark-reading.png" alt="Librarian: Change the reading light. The supported Dark control changes the same spread to a dimmer reading view. The page content stays in place for comparison." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Change the reading light</h3><p>The supported Dark control changes the same spread to a dimmer reading view. The page content stays in place for comparison.</p></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-librarian-panel-3" aria-labelledby="after-hours-librarian-tab-3" hidden><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/librarian-04-retained.png" alt="Librarian: Return to the shelf. After a full reload, both PDFs remain in the local library. Materials and Sound reopens with its original diagrams and text." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Return to the shelf</h3><p>After a full reload, both PDFs remain in the local library. Materials and Sound reopens with its original diagrams and text.</p></div></div><p class="ah-count" data-ah-count role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="ah-actions"><a class="ah-primary" href="https://librarian.thecreatingco.com/">Open Librarian ↗</a><button type="button" data-ah-expand>Inspect the screenshot</button><button type="button" data-ah-toggle-compare aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="after-hours-librarian-compare">Compare the reading modes</button></div><div class="ah-output