-1" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" data-story-frame><img src="/assets/creative-tools/press.webp" alt="Press starting workspace for an artist profile." loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="1000"><figcaption>Press starting workspace for an artist profile.</figcaption></figure><figure class="tcc-story-frame" id="product-story-press-2" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" data-story-frame><img src="/assets/tool-products/press.webp" alt="Press actual workspace capture for a fictional artist example." loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1600" height="1000"><figcaption>Press actual workspace capture for a fictional artist example.</figcaption></figure></div><nav class="tcc-story-controls" data-story-controls role="tablist" aria-label="Press visual tour" hidden></nav></div><div class="tcc-story-copy"><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">01 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 02</p><h3>Start with your profile</h3><p>Bring the artist details and links you want people to find.</p></article><article class="tcc-story-step" data-story-step><p class="tcc-story-count">02 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> 02</p><h3>Arrange the story</h3><p>Explore how an artist page brings music, bio and links together.</p></article><p class="tcc-story-status tcc-story-sr-only" data-story-status role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-band" id="what-it-does" aria-labelledby="features-title"><div class="tp-inner"><p class="tp-eyebrow">FROM IDEA TO OUTPUT</p><h2 id="features-title">Make it your own.</h2><div class="tp-features"><div class="tp-feature"><span class="tp-number">01</span><h3>Your story in one place</h3><p>Bring identity, music, press quotes and contact details together.</p></div><div class="tp-feature"><span class="tp-number">02</span><h3>A presentation you control</h3><p>Choose a layout, accent and light or dark treatment.</p></div><div class="tp-feature"><span class="tp-number">03</span><h3>A file you can take away</h3><p>Download HTML, print to PDF or save a portable draft.</p></div></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-band tp-making" id="make" aria-labelledby="make-title"><span id="how-it-works"></span><div class="tp-inner"><p class="tp-eyebrow">A GOOD PLACE TO BEGIN</p><h2 id="make-title">One tool. Three starting points.</h2><div class="tp-lesson" data-tp-player><div class="tp-lesson-toolbar" data-tp-controls hidden><label for="project-picker">Project</label><select id="project-picker" data-tp-picker><option value="0">A first artist EPK</option><option value="1">A release link page</option><option value="2">A printable introduction</option></select><div class="tp-cycle"><button type="button" data-tp-previous aria-label="Previous project" title="Previous project"><svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg></button><span data-tp-count role="status" aria-live="polite">1 / 3</span><button type="button" data-tp-next aria-label="Next project" title="Next project"><svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg></button></div></div><div class="tp-lesson-content"><article data-tp-lesson aria-labelledby="lesson-0"><h3 id="lesson-0">A first artist EPK</h3><p>Build a concise introduction for a booker or journalist.</p><ol><li>Add an artist name, short bio, photo and one representative track.</li><li>Include contact information and only quotes you have permission to use.</li><li>Preview the layout, download HTML and arrange hosting separately.</li></ol></article><article data-tp-lesson hidden aria-labelledby="lesson-1"><h3 id="lesson-1">A release link page</h3><p>Give a new release a focused set of links.</p><ol><li>Add a short release description and your listening links.</li><li>Choose an accent that works with your artwork and review the preview.</li><li>Download HTML and test each link before sharing the hosted page.</li></ol></article><article data-tp-lesson hidden aria-labelledby="lesson-2"><h3 id="lesson-2">A printable introduction</h3><p>Make a compact document for an offline conversation.</p><ol><li>Keep the bio concise and use a clearly readable photo.</li><li>Check that links and contact details are useful without embedded players.</li><li>Print to PDF and review the pages before sending them.</li></ol></article></div><div class="tp-lesson-footer"><a class="tp-primary" href="https://sattarimusic.com/press" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Make it in Press <svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"/><path d="M10 14 21 3"/><path d="M21 14v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5"/></svg></a></div></div></div></section>
