iles.</p><p class="ph-description">Review your storage on Mac, quarantine selected items and restore what you keep. Or compare selected files in the read-only browser companion.</p><div class="ph-actions"><a class="ph-open" href="https://github.com/armonon/studio-downloads/releases/download/reclaim-v0.1.1/Reclaim-0.1.1-macOS-universal.dmg">Download for Mac</a><a href="https://reclaim.thecreatingco.com/browser/">Open web preview</a></div><p class="ph-scope">Free Mac alpha · Intel + Apple Silicon · macOS 13+</p><!-- ALPHA-ACCESS:START --><p class="other-app-status">Public alpha · <a href="#reclaim-mac">Availability &amp; current scope</a> · <a href="/testing/?product=reclaim#feedback">Send feedback</a></p><!-- ALPHA-ACCESS:END --></div><div class="ph-media"><figure class="other-app-hero other-app-reclaim"><a href="#product-lessons" aria-label="Try Reclaim"><img src="/assets/notable/reclaim.png" alt="Reclaim app icon" width="1710" height="1069" fetchpriority="high"></a></figure></div></section><section class="reclaim-release section" id="reclaim-mac" aria-labelledby="reclaim-mac-title"><div class="reclaim-release-heading"><img src="/assets/notable/reclaim.png" alt="" width="72" height="72" loading="lazy"><div><p class="overline">FREE MAC DOWNLOAD / PUBLIC ALPHA</p><h2 id="reclaim-mac-title">Reclaim for Mac.</h2></div></div><p>Review storage, quarantine selected items and restore what you keep. Automatic permanent deletion is off unless you explicitly enable it.</p><p class="reclaim-release-spec">Version 0.1.1 · macOS 13 or later · Apple Silicon + Intel · 13.0 MB</p><div class="reclaim-release-actions"><a class="reclaim-download" href="https://github.com/armonon/studio-downloads/releases/download/reclaim-v0.1.1/Reclaim-0.1.1-macOS-universal.dmg">Download for Mac</a><a href="https://reclaim.thecreatingco.com/browser/">Try the read-only web preview</a></div><p class="reclaim-release-trust">Developer ID signed and Apple-notarized. Free to download; no account required.</p><details><summary>Install, safety &amp; release details</summary><ol><li>Open the downloaded DMG.</li><li>Drag Reclaim into Applications, then open it there.</li><li>Start with disposable files and check restore. Keep a current backup.</li></ol><p>This is an alpha, not a fully qualified stable release. Clean-machine, physical Intel and oldest-macOS testing remain outstanding. Review each cleanup selection. Emptying quarantine permanently deletes its contents.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/armonon/studio-downloads/releases/tag/reclaim-v0.1.1">Release notes</a> · <a href="/downloads/reclaim/SHA256SUMS.txt">SHA-256 checksum</a> · <a href="/testing/?product=reclaim#feedback">Report a problem</a></p></details></section><!-- PRODUCT-REFRESH:START --><section class="mini-player" id="product-lessons" data-mini-product="reclaim" aria-label="Reclaim mini lessons"><div class="mini-heading"><h2>Try a file review.</h2></div><div class="mini-controls" role="group" aria-label="Lesson navigation"><label for="mini-lesson-reclaim">Choose a lesson</label><button type="button" data-mini-cycle="previous" aria-label="Previous lesson" title="Previous lesson"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg></button><select id="mini-lesson-reclaim" data-mini-select=""><option value="duplicates" data-src="/learn/product-try/reclaim/?miniLesson=duplicates" data-poster="/assets/presentation/reclaim-duplicates-viewport.png" data-description="Use SHA-256 to identify identical sample contents.">Find the identical pair</option><option value="names" data-src="/learn/product-try/reclaim/?miniLesson=names" data-poster="/assets/presentation/reclaim-duplicates-viewport.png" data-description="Verify why matching filenames are not proof of matching contents.">Look beyond the filename</option></select><button type="button" data-mini-cycle="next" aria-label="Next lesson" title="Next lesson"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></button><p class="mini-count" data-mini-count="" role="status" aria-live="polite">Lesson 1 of 2</p></div><div class="mini-box"><header class="mini-bar"><h3 data-mini-title="">Find the identical pair</h3><button type="button" data-mini-expand="" aria-label="Expand lesson" title="Expand lesson"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></header><div class="mini-stage" data-mini-stage=""><img data-mini-poster="" src="/assets/presentation/reclaim-duplicates-viewport.png" alt="Find the identical pair product example" loading="lazy"><button type="button" data-mini-open="">Open lesson</button></div><footer class="mini-footer"><p data-mini-description="">Use SHA-256 to identify identical sample contents.</p><p role="status" data-mini-status=""></p><a data-mini-full="" href="/learn/product-try/reclaim/?miniLesson=duplicates">Continue this lesson</a></footer></div></section><!-- PRODUCT-REFRESH:END --><!-- PRODUCT-EXAMPLES:START --><!-- PRODUCT-LESSONS:START --><!-- PRODUCT-LESSONS:END --><!-- PRODUCT-EXAMPLES:END --><!-- PRODUCT-FEATURES:START --><section class="pf" id="product-features" aria-labelledby="pf-title" data-product-features="reclaim" style="--pf-accent:#a9f09e"><div class="pf-intro"><div><p class="pf-eyebrow">INSIDE RECLAIM</p><h2 id="pf-title">What Reclaim can do.</h2><p class="pf-lede">Download the Mac alpha for storage review, quarantine and restore. The browser companion compares selected files without changing them.</p></div><p class="pf-total"><strong>16</strong><span>features to explore</span></p></div><aside class="pf-scope" aria-label="Edition and availability"><p><strong>Full product inventory. Web, native and experimental capabilities vary by edition.</strong> The browser companion is read-only. Mac cleanup and quarantine belong to the native app. The older general computer-operator and coding panels are not part of Reclaim’s current visible product.</p></aside><div class="pr-search"><label for="pr-feature-search">Find a capability</label><input id="pr-feature-search" type="search" data-pr-search="" placeholder="Search tools, workflows or editions" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="pr-feature-status"><p id="pr-feature-status" data-pr-search-status="" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><nav class="pf-jump" aria-label="Feature categories"><a href="#pf-reclaim-1">Understand your storage</a><a href="#pf-reclaim-2">Review, quarantine &amp; restore</a><a href="#pf-reclaim-3">Guidance &amp; assistance</a><a href="#pf-reclaim-4">The read-only web companion</a></nav><details class="pf-group" id="pf-reclaim-1"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Understand your storage</h3><span class="pf-group-count">5 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Smart Scan</h4><span class="pf-edition">native</span></div><p>Inspect storage and assemble cleanup categories with progress updates.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Storage overview</h4><span class="pf-edition">native</span></div><p>See capacity, used space, available space, and measured categories.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Space map</h4><span class="pf-edition">native</span></div><p>Drill into folders and large storage consumers.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Duplicate discovery</h4><span class="pf-edition">native</span></div><p>Find duplicate candidates across selected locations.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Reviewable cleanup</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Inspect categories and individual items before approving removal.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-reclaim-2"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Review, quarantine &amp; restore</h3><span class="pf-group-count">4 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Quarantine</h4><span class="pf-edition">native</span></div><p>Move selected items into a recoverable holding area.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Restore</h4><span class="pf-edition">native</span></div><p>Restore retained items from quarantine.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Retention controls</h4><span class="pf-edition">native</span></div><p>Manage how long quarantined items remain; automatic permanent removal requires an explicitly confirmed policy.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Deliberate permanent removal</h4><span class="pf-edition">native</span></div><p>Empty individual batches or the quarantine with confirmation.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-reclaim-3"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Guidance &amp; assistance</h3><span class="pf-group-count">3 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Access guidance</h4><span class="pf-edition">native</span></div><p>Show permission and Full Disk Access limitations.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Additional savings</h4><span class="pf-edition">native</span></div><p>Surface storage-management suggestions.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>AI assistance</h4><span class="pf-edition">native</span></div><p>Ask storage questions and use supported natural-language file-review flows with the configured provider.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-reclaim-4"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>The read-only web companion</h3><span class="pf-group-count">4 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Selected-file review</h4><span class="pf-edition">web</span></div><p>Inspect files or a folder you explicitly choose.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Content comparison</h4><span class="pf-edition">web</span></div><p>Compare eligible equal-size files using SHA-256; oversized files remain labeled “Not compared.”</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Search and filters</h4><span class="pf-edition">web</span></div><p>Find filenames and filter duplicate groups or unexamined files.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Report export</h4><span class="pf-edition">web</span></div><p>Download a review report without changing the original files.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details></section><!-- PRODUCT-FEATURES:END --><div class="section" style="padding-block:0"></div><!-- AFTER-HOURS:reclaim:START --><section class="ah" id="after-hours-reclaim" data-after-hours="reclaim" style="--ah-accent:#176742"><p class="ah-eyebrow">AFTER HOURS / Reclaim / File review · read-only</p><h2>Find the copies worth reviewing.</h2><p class="ah-deck">An exhibition folder contains working files, exports, backups, and two notes with the same name. Compare their actual content before making a decision.</p><div class="ah-chapters" role="tablist" aria-label="Exhibition Folder Review chapters"><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-reclaim-tab-0" aria-controls="after-hours-reclaim-panel-0" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0"><span>01</span>See the selected set</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-reclaim-tab-1" aria-controls="after-hours-reclaim-panel-1" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>02</span>Match the bytes</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-reclaim-tab-2" aria-controls="after-hours-reclaim-panel-2" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>03</span>Narrow the review</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-reclaim-tab-3" aria-controls="after-hours-reclaim-panel-3" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>04</span>Keep the evidence</button></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-reclaim-panel-0" aria-labelledby="after-hours-reclaim-tab-0"><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/reclaim-01-review.png" alt="Reclaim: See the selected set. Seven original demonstration files total about 6.3 MB. The review lists their names and sizes and finds two groups of identical content." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>See the selected set</h3><p>Seven original demonstration files total about 6.3 MB. The review lists their names and sizes and finds two groups of identical content.</p></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-reclaim-panel-1" aria-labelledby="after-hours-reclaim-tab-1" hidden=""><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/reclaim-02-duplicates.png" alt="Reclaim: Match the bytes. A PDF pair and an audio pair match despite their different filenames. Together, the extra copies account for 3,277,228 bytes; no files were deleted." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Match the bytes</h3><p>A PDF pair and an audio pair match despite their different filenames. Together, the extra copies account for 3,277,228 bytes; no files were deleted.</p></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-reclaim-panel-2" aria-labelledby="after-hours-reclaim-tab-2" hidden=""><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/reclaim-03-search.png" alt="Reclaim: Narrow the review. Searching Field-Notes isolates the working PDF and its final-copy counterpart while preserving the full review." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Narrow the review</h3><p>Searching Field-Notes isolates the working PDF and its final-copy counterpart while preserving the full review.</p></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-reclaim-panel-3" aria-labelledby="after-hours-reclaim-tab-3" hidden=""><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/reclaim-04-report.png" alt="Reclaim: Keep the evidence. Two 67-byte notes.txt files have different contents and are not grouped as duplicates. The downloaded JSON report records the comparison results." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ah-caption"><h3>Keep the evidence</h3><p>Two 67-byte notes.txt files have different contents and are not grouped as duplicates. The downloaded JSON report records the comparison results.</p></div></div><p class="ah-count" data-ah-count="" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="ah-actions"><a class="ah-primary" href="https://reclaim.thecreatingco.com/browser/">Open Reclaim ↗</a><button type="button" data-ah-expand="">Inspect the screenshot</button></div><div class="ah-actions"><a href="/assets/after-hours/outputs/after-hours-file-review.json" download="">Download the actual review report</a></div><p class="ah-note">Actual read-only browser review of disposable fixtures. The downloaded report was parsed against all seven original names, sizes and available hashes. Every source hash remained unchanged. This is selected-file review, not a system scan or a claim of reclaimed disk space.</p><dialog aria-labelledby="after-hours-reclaim-dialog-title"><button type="button" autofocus="">Close screenshot</button><p id="after-hours-reclaim-dialog-title" data-ah-dialog-title=""></p><img alt=""></dialog></section><!-- AFTER-HOURS:reclaim:END --><section class="scope-section section" id="browser"><div><p class="overline">YOUR BROWSER EDITION</p><h2>Your web edition.</h2><p>Inspect files you select, find identical copies by content, sort large files, and export a review report.</p><details open=""><summary>Current limitations</summary><p>This read-only browser companion cannot scan your whole Mac, clear caches, quarantine or delete files. It is a scoped testing experience for file review, not the native cleanup engine.</p></details></div><div class="try-card"><h3>One good first test</h3><ol><li><span>01</span>Select a folder or a set of files.</li><li><span>02</span>Review sizes and content-matched duplicates.</li><li><span>03</span>Export the report. Your files remain unchanged.</li></ol><a class="button accent primary-app" href="https://reclaim.thecreatingco.com/browser/">Open the browser companion</a><a href="/testing/?product=reclaim#feedback">Send feedback</a></div></section><!-- PRODUCT-NEXT:START --><section class="pr-next" aria-labelledby="pr-next-title"><p class="pr-kicker">OTHER APPS FROM THECREATECO</p><h2 id="pr-next-title">More room for your curiosity.</h2><div class="pr-cards"><a class="pr-card" href="/products/ghost/" style="--pr-tone:#a2ead6"><h3>Ghost Studio</h3><p>See your references in another dimension.</p><span class="pr-card-label">Explore the product<b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a><a class="pr-card" href="/products/librarian/" style="--pr-tone:#83d7ff"><h3>Librarian</h3><p>Keep the ideas you want to return to.</p><spa