les.</p><p class="feature-availability">Try the browser workshop online. Initial editor and example assets require a network connection.</p><a class="pf-example-link" href="/products/scenepilot/?lesson=delivery#learn-studio">Try this feature ↗</a></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases="auto cut autocut beat sync rhythm music video"><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>AutoCut · beat-aware first cuts</h4><span class="pf-edition">Browser Lite / Pro</span></div><p>Analyze the soundtrack, generate an editable first cut, then refine its rhythm or hold a shot longer.</p><p class="feature-availability">Try the browser workshop online. Initial editor and example assets require a network connection.</p><a class="pf-example-link" href="/products/scenepilot/?lesson=autocut#learn-studio">Try this feature ↗</a></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Draft review</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Preview a proposed cut before applying it to the active edit.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Timeline editing</h4><span class="pf-edition">Browser Lite / Pro</span></div><p>Arrange, split, trim, move, and refine clips.</p><p class="feature-availability">Try the browser workshop online. Initial editor and example assets require a network connection.</p><a class="pf-example-link" href="/products/scenepilot/?lesson=trim#learn-studio">Try this feature ↗</a></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Source editing</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Mark source ranges and use supported insert, overwrite, and fit-to-fill workflows.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-scenepilot-2"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Refine the timeline &amp; sound</h3><span class="pf-group-count">5 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Multitrack editing</h4><span class="pf-edition">Pro</span></div><p>Combine multiple video and audio tracks.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Linked audio</h4><span class="pf-edition">Pro</span></div><p>Preserve supported picture/audio relationships during editing.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Audio controls</h4><span class="pf-edition">Pro</span></div><p>Decoded waveforms, clip gain, panning, fades, crossfades, and volume automation.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Timing tools</h4><span class="pf-edition">Pro</span></div><p>Supported speed changes, rate stretching, and professional trim operations.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Transitions and effects</h4><span class="pf-edition">Browser Lite / Pro</span></div><p>Apply and preview available transitions, effects, grading, and generated visuals.</p><p class="feature-availability">Try the browser workshop online. Initial editor and example assets require a network connection.</p><a class="pf-example-link" href="/products/scenepilot/?lesson=transition#learn-studio">Try this feature ↗</a></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-scenepilot-3"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Motion, compositing &amp; AI</h3><span class="pf-group-count">6 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases="blend blending screen multiply overlay opacity double exposure"><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Browser blending &amp; opacity</h4><span class="pf-edition">Browser lesson</span></div><p>Layer two scenes using Screen, Multiply or Overlay, then balance overlay opacity in the working browser lesson.</p><p class="feature-availability">Online workshop; source footage loads over the network.</p><a class="pf-example-link" href="/products/scenepilot/?lesson=blend#learn-studio">Try blending ↗</a></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Motion compositions</h4><span class="pf-edition">Pro</span></div><p>Combine text, footage, shapes, and other layers in reusable compositions.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Animation</h4><span class="pf-edition">Pro</span></div><p>Keyframes, easing, value graphs, motion controls, parenting, nulls, and precompositions.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Masks and compositing</h4><span class="pf-edition">Pro</span></div><p>Build nested compositions, masks and mattes in Pro. The browser workshop has its own simpler two-scene blend controls.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Rotoscoping and removal</h4><span class="pf-edition">experimental/Pro</span></div><p>Person and object isolation paths, plus removal tools requiring shot-by-shot review.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Transcription and captions</h4><span class="pf-edition">beta</span></div><p>Speech transcription and transcript/caption editing workflows.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details><details class="pf-group" id="pf-scenepilot-4"><summary><span class="pf-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>Organize &amp; deliver</h3><span class="pf-group-count">4 features</span></summary><ul class="pf-feature-list"><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Project organization</h4><span class="pf-edition">Pro</span></div><p>Media bins, proxies, relinking, recovery history, and saved projects.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Reusable creative assets</h4><span class="pf-edition">Pro</span></div><p>Extension packs containing compositions, looks, and effect recipes.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Delivery</h4><span class="pf-edition">Edition varies</span></div><p>Browser Lite targets local 1080p H.264 delivery; Pro adds broader profiles, 4K workflows, and a persistent render queue.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li><li class="pf-feature" data-feature-aliases=""><div class="pf-feature-heading"><h4>Audio/interchange outputs</h4><span class="pf-edition">Pro</span></div><p>Supported WAV stem and OpenTimelineIO workflows.</p><p class="feature-availability">See release status for this edition. Offline operation is not confirmed for this capability.</p></li></ul></details></section><!-- PRODUCT-FEATURES:END --><!-- AFTER-HOURS:scenepilot:START --><details class="secondary-reference"><summary>Project walkthrough: After Hours<span>Open reference ↗</span></summary><section class="ah ah-walkthrough" id="after-hours-scenepilot" data-after-hours="scenepilot" aria-labelledby="after-hours-scenepilot-title" style="--ah-accent:#7971ee"><div class="ah-case-meta"><p class="ah-eyebrow">AFTER HOURS / PROJECT WALKTHROUGH</p><span>Captured in ScenePilot · Browser Lite</span></div><h2 id="after-hours-scenepilot-title">An evening, in eighteen seconds.</h2><p class="ah-deck">See how artwork, a jacket study and a Form clasp become an editable 18-second exhibition trailer, set to a StemDeck soundtrack.</p><ul class="ah-facts" aria-label="Project at a glance"><li><strong>3</strong> source clips</li><li><strong>18 seconds</strong> editable timeline</li><li><strong>StemDeck</strong> soundtrack</li></ul><div class="ah-walkthrough-guide"><p><strong>Follow the edit.</strong> Choose a step to see what changed in the real workspace.</p><span>Editor screenshots · 4 steps</span></div><div class="ah-chapters" role="tablist" aria-label="After Hours editing steps"><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-scenepilot-tab-0" aria-controls="after-hours-scenepilot-panel-0" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0"><span>01</span>Import the sources</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-scenepilot-tab-1" aria-controls="after-hours-scenepilot-panel-1" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>02</span>Build the first cut</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-scenepilot-tab-2" aria-controls="after-hours-scenepilot-panel-2" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>03</span>Add soft transitions</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="after-hours-scenepilot-tab-3" aria-controls="after-hours-scenepilot-panel-3" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span>04</span>Save and reopen</button></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-scenepilot-panel-0" aria-labelledby="after-hours-scenepilot-tab-0" ><div class="ah-caption"><div><p class="ah-step">STEP 1 / 4</p><h3>Import the sources</h3></div><p>Start with three short clips: artwork made for Luma, a jacket reference from Ghost, and a clasp rendered in Form. Add the 18-second StemDeck mix as the soundtrack.</p></div><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/scenepilot-01-sources.png" alt="ScenePilot editor screenshot: Import the sources. Start with three short clips: artwork made for Luma, a jacket reference from Ghost, and a clasp rendered in Form. Add the 18-second StemDeck mix as the soundtrack." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-scenepilot-panel-1" aria-labelledby="after-hours-scenepilot-tab-1" hidden><div class="ah-caption"><div><p class="ah-step">STEP 2 / 4</p><h3>Build the first cut</h3></div><p>Let Cinematic mode analyze the soundtrack and suggest an arrangement. This project creates ten main cuts and five overlays. Every shot stays editable.</p></div><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/scenepilot-02-first-cut.png" alt="ScenePilot editor screenshot: Build the first cut. Let Cinematic mode analyze the soundtrack and suggest an arrangement. This project creates ten main cuts and five overlays. Every shot stays editable." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-scenepilot-panel-2" aria-labelledby="after-hours-scenepilot-tab-2" hidden><div class="ah-caption"><div><p class="ah-step">STEP 3 / 4</p><h3>Add soft transitions</h3></div><p>Replace the incoming Zoom transition with a 0.30-second Dissolve, then apply it across the main cuts. The scenes blend gently as each new shot arrives.</p></div><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/scenepilot-03-dissolves.png" alt="ScenePilot editor screenshot: Add soft transitions. Replace the incoming Zoom transition with a 0.30-second Dissolve, then apply it across the main cuts. The scenes blend gently as each new shot arrives." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div></div><div role="tabpanel" id="after-hours-scenepilot-panel-3" aria-labelledby="after-hours-scenepilot-tab-3" hidden><div class="ah-caption"><div><p class="ah-step">STEP 4 / 4</p><h3>Save and reopen</h3></div><p>Save the project, then restore it in the same browser. The three source clips, soundtrack, 15 timeline items and effects return together. Export the cut file to keep the edit instructions.</p></div><div class="ah-stage"><img src="/assets/after-hours/scenepilot-04-restored.png" alt="ScenePilot editor screenshot: Save and reopen. Save the project, then restore it in the same browser. The three source clips, soundtrack, 15 timeline items and effects return together. Export the cut file to keep the edit instructions." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="ah-capture-tools"><p class="ah-count" data-ah-count role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button type="button" data-ah-expand>Enlarge screenshot ↗</button></div><div class="ah-reopen"><div><p class="ah-eyebrow">KEEP MAKING</p><h3>Continue this project.</h3><p>The complete ZIP includes the editable cut, three MP4 source clips and the soundtrack. The cut file stores your editing choices; the media files supply the picture and sound.</p><div class="ah-actions"><a class="ah-primary" href="/assets/after-hours/outputs/after-hours-scene-sources.zip" download>Download project + sources ↓</a><a href="https://scenepilot.thecreatingco.com/app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open ScenePilot ↗</a></div></div><ol aria-label="Open the downloaded project"><li><strong>Download &amp; unzip.</strong><span>Keep all the project files together.</span></li><li><strong>Open the cut file.</strong><span>In ScenePilot, import after-hours-exhibition.scenepilot.json.</span></li><li><strong>Relink the source media.</strong><span>Import the matching three MP4s and WAV from the ZIP to reconnect picture and sound.</span></li></ol></div><p class="ah-note">Real screenshots from ScenePilot Browser Lite. The download contains the editable cut and its original source media. A finished trailer MP4 is not included.</p><dialog aria-labelledby="after-hours-scenepilot-dialog-title"><button type="button" autofocus>Close screenshot</button><p id="after-hours-scenepilot-dialog-title" data-ah-dialog-title></p><img alt=""></dialog></section></details><!-- AFTER-HOURS:scenepilot:END --><section class="scope-section section" id="browser"><div><p class="overline">YOUR BROWSER EDITION</p><h2>Your web edition.</h2><p>Try the existing Browser Lite editor with your own media and a beat-aware edit.</p><details open><summary>Current limitations</summary><p>Desktop Pro adds native media processing, inference and delivery features. Browser decoding and export depend on available codecs and memory. Native release qualification is incomplete; Intel is unqualified.</p></details></div><div class="try-card"><h3>One good first test</h3><ol><li><span>01</span>Open Browser Lite and import a short clip.</li><li><span>02</span>Build and adjust a short sequence.</li><li><span>03</span>Test preview and a supported export.</li></ol><a class="button accent primary-app" href="https://scenepilot.thecreatingco.com/app/">Open the browser app</a><a href="/testing/?product=scenepilot#feedback">Send feedback</a></div></section><section class="section prose" id="new-tools"><p class="overline">NEW IN SCENEPILOT</p><h2>Four new tools alongside the editor.</h2><p>All four are public web alpha, open straight from your browser.</p><h3 id="autocut">AutoCut</h3><p>A dedicated auto-editor for videos and music videos: beat- and energy-driven cuts, presets, multi-take lip-sync alignment, and 9:16 / 1:1 / 16:9 export. Opens into the main ScenePilot editor for further changes. <a href="https://scenepilot.thecreatingco.com/tools/autocut/">Open AutoCut <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a> &middot; <a href="/products/autocut/">More about AutoCut</a></p><h3 id="captions">Captions</h3><p>On-device speech-to-text with animated caption styles. Burn captions into a WebM export, or take the SRT/VTT file elsewhere. <a href="https://scenepilot.thecreatingco.com/tools/captions/">Open Captions <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a> &middot; <a href="/products/captions/">More about Captions</a></p><h3 id="board">Board</h3><p>Turn a script into a shot list and storyboard, with PDF/CSV export and timeline markers you can carry into the edit. <a href="https://scenepilot.thecreatingco.com/tools/board/">Open Board <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a> &middot; <a href="/products/board/">More about Board</a></p><h3 id="grade">Grade</h3><p>Pick a reference still and pull a color grade from it, then export a .cube LUT for use elsewhere. <a href="https://scenepilot.thecreatingco.com/tools/grade/">Open Grade <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a> &middot; <a href="/products/grade/">More about Grade</a></p></section><!-- PRODUCT-NEXT:START --><section class="pr-next" aria-labelledby="pr-next-title"><p class="pr-kicker">THE FOUR-PRODUCT CREATIVE SUITE</p><h2 id="pr-next-title">Keep the idea moving.</h2><div class="pr-cards"><a class="pr-card" href="/products/form/" style="--pr-tone:#d8ff3e"><h3>Form Studio</h3><p>Give your next idea a dimension.</p><span class="pr-card-label">Explore the product<b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a><a class="pr-card" href="/products/luma/" style="--pr-tone:#ff83ba"><h3>Luma Studio</h3><p>Turn your images into a visual world.</p><span class="pr-card-label">Explore the product<b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a><a class="pr-card" href="/products/stemdeck/" style="--pr-tone:#ffb05e"><h3>StemDeck</h3><p>Find the mix. Make the moment.</p><span class="pr-card-label">Explore the product<b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a></div></section><!-- PRODUCT-NEXT:END --></main><footer class="mm-footer"><div><a class="wordmark" href="/">thecreateco.</a><p>For whatever you’re into next. <a class="brand-domain" href="https://thecreatingco.com/">thecreatingco.com</a></p></div><nav aria-label="Footer"><a href="/#creative-suite">Creative Suite</a><a href="/#other-apps">Other apps</a><a href="/learn/">Learning library</a><a href="/testing/">Testing &amp; feedback</a><a href="/downloads/">Release status</a><a href="/about/">About thecreateco</a><a href="/privacy/">Data &amp; privacy</a><a href="/work/">Your work</a><a href="/community/network">Community</a><a href="/kickstarter/">Kickstarter &amp; launch list ↗</a></nav><small>Independent creative tools · Public testing editions</small></footer><dialog class="mm-launch-dialog" aria-labelledby="mm-launch-title"><div class="mm-dialog-heading"><h2 id="mm-launch-title">Where do you want to go?</h2><button type="button" data-mm-close aria-label="Close quick launch" title="Close quick launch"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button></div><label for="mm-launch-search">Find a product, collection or creative discipline</label><input id="mm-launch-search" type="search" placeholder="Try “sound”, “film” or “Locker”" autocomplete="off"><div class="mm-launch-list"><section data-mm-launch-group="make" aria-label="Make"><h3 class="mm-la