 <section class="tp-band tp-making" id="make" aria-labelledby="make-title"><span id="how-it-works"></span><div class="tp-inner"><p class="tp-eyebrow">A GOOD PLACE TO BEGIN</p><h2 id="make-title">One tool. Three starting points.</h2><div class="tp-lesson" data-tp-player><div class="tp-lesson-toolbar" data-tp-controls hidden><label for="project-picker">Project</label><select id="project-picker" data-tp-picker><option value="0">Study your own mix</option><option value="1">An instrumental practice version</option><option value="2">A StemDeck starting point</option></select><div class="tp-cycle"><button type="button" data-tp-previous aria-label="Previous project" title="Previous project"><svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg></button><span data-tp-count role="status" aria-live="polite">1 / 3</span><button type="button" data-tp-next aria-label="Next project" title="Next project"><svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg></button></div></div><div class="tp-lesson-content"><article data-tp-lesson aria-labelledby="lesson-0"><h3 id="lesson-0">Study your own mix</h3><p>Hear how the bass and drums share the groove.</p><ol><li>Import a short song you own or have permission to process.</li><li>Let the model load, separate the track and solo drums, then bass.</li><li>Download the stems and compare them with the original mix.</li></ol></article><article data-tp-lesson hidden aria-labelledby="lesson-1"><h3 id="lesson-1">An instrumental practice version</h3><p>Explore a vocal-muted version for rehearsal.</p><ol><li>Choose a song you have rights to use and run separation.</li><li>Mute vocals and listen for bleed or missing musical details.</li><li>Export useful stems; do not mistake separation for studio multitracks.</li></ol></article><article data-tp-lesson hidden aria-labelledby="lesson-2"><h3 id="lesson-2">A StemDeck starting point</h3><p>Bring separated parts into a mixing session.</p><ol><li>Separate a short track and audition all four stems.</li><li>Download backups before leaving Split.</li><li>Send to StemDeck and check the parts in the receiving session.</li></ol></article></div><div class="tp-lesson-footer"><a class="tp-primary" href="https://sattarimusic.com/studio/split" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Make it in Split <svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"/><path d="M10 14 21 3"/><path d="M21 14v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5"/></svg></a></div></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-band" id="exports" aria-labelledby="exports-title"><div class="tp-inner tp-export-layout"><div><p class="tp-eyebrow">YOUR WORK, TO KEEP</p><h2 id="exports-title">Take the result with you.</h2><p>Results are not automatically backed up. Download the WAVs or complete the StemDeck handoff before leaving.</p></div><dl class="tp-exports"><div><dt>WAV stems</dt><dd>Vocals, drums, bass and remaining instruments.</dd></div><div><dt>StemDeck handoff</dt><dd>Bring separated parts into the Sattari audio workspace.</dd></div><div><dt>Original media</dt><dd>Keep your source track separately.</dd></div></dl></div></section>
 <section class="tp-band tp-notes" id="limits" aria-labelledby="limits-title"><div class="tp-inner tp-note-layout"><div><p class="tp-eyebrow">BUILDING IN PUBLIC</p><h2 id="limits-title">An alpha. An invitation.</h2><p>Try it, make something, and tell us what needs to work better.</p><a class="tp-feedback" href="/testing/?product=split#feedback">Send Split feedback <svg class="lucide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"/><path d="M10 14 21 3"/><path d="M21 14v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5"/></svg></a></div><div class="tp-questions"><details open><summary>What should I know before starting?</summary><p>Expect bleed and artifacts, especially on dense mixes. The first run downloads a large model and CPU processing can take minutes. Phone/tablet performance is unqualified. Separation does not grant rights to reuse someone else&#x27;s music.</p></details><details><summary>How do I keep my work?</summary><p>Results are not automatically backed up. Download the WAVs or complete the StemDeck handoff before leaving.</p></details><details><summary>Can I download a native app?</summary><p>This page opens the public web alpha. There are no public native downloads yet. <a href="/downloads/">Check current availability.</a></p></details></div></div></section>
